SUMMARY:That Time of the Month: Women Artists Showcase hosted by Melissa McKinney and Gill Francis
DESCRIPTION:Gill Francis & Melissa McKinney are hosting “That Time of the Month\,” a series focused on the Talented Female Singer/Songwriters of Asheville. \nThis series will take place the second Monday of each month\, and each show will feature a new artist. The ladies will share their songs\, the stories behind them\, and the artists that inspired them! \nWe’re so excited for these ladies to bring incredible women to our taproom stage each month! \n6-9 PM | Free Show | All Ages | Food & Drink On-site \n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/that-time-of-the-month-women-artists-showcase-hosted-by-melissa-mckinney-and-gill-francis/2026-06-08/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/oo-scaled-1-e1778027916491.png
